vu0: VCLIP compares against |w| and orders the flags as the VU does (+x in
bit 0, -x in bit 1, ...). runtime: PS2X_WRITE_WATCH=<hex addr>[:<hex len>]
reports every guest store into that range with its code address and $ra
(the store hooks were empty stubs).

